# CMake generated files. The build/ rules above only help when the build tree is
# actually build/ -- a stray in-source `cmake .` at the repo root writes these
# into EVERY directory holding a CMakeLists.txt, which buries real changes under
# ~150 untracked entries. These names have no tracked counterpart, so ignoring
# them everywhere is safe; the one tracked Makefile is re-included below.
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
cmake_install.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
Makefile
!external/bam/gnb/Makefile
compile_commands.json
_deps/
venv

